    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001000410050,
    "label": "1003001000412",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "緊張しないで、楽しく話ができそう！\r\nやっぱり、行き慣れたお店がいいよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100300100041/1003001000410050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001000410060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "最近、新しいハンバーガーが出たみたいだから、\r\nそれを食べに行くのもいいなぁ",
